WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.493 --> 00:00:10.695
The WBS, or work breakdown, is the plan for the job: phases, and the tasks inside each phase.

2
00:00:10.696 --> 00:00:17.476
Each task has its own dates, progress and budget. Open a phase to see the tasks under it.

3
00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:30.658
To plan new work, press Add Task. Name the activity, pick its phase, location and parent task, then set the planned start and finish. The resources and budget go in further down.

4
00:00:30.658 --> 00:00:42.156
When work is done on a task, press Log Work. Enter the date and progress, the materials used, the labour on site and any equipment, then add a note or photos.
